  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT 23-0000901 Initiative pour l&#x2019;&#xe9;limination des Mutilations G&#xe9;nitales F&#xe9;minines et des Mariages d&#x2019;enfants dans les r&#xe9;gions Matam et K&#xe9;dougou</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPACT 23-0000901 The project has the ambition to realize capacity building of youth in order to create a movement of activists, mobilizing public opinion, engage political leaders and decision makers and put in place preventive measures regarding elimination of Female Genital Mutilation (FGM) and child marriage in the regions Matam and K&#xe9;dougou.</narrative>
  </description>
